    {
      "sourceRef": "index:41",
      "cellIndex": 41,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### Over-damped, $\\zeta > 1$\nIf the damping is even more pronounced, e.g. $\\zeta = 2$.",
      "sourceSha256": "b7d477720b5ffc24b17997669d646f0a7a0f8098c04194ff07c0732b334484e9",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": [
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "\\zeta > 1"
        },
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "\\zeta = 2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:42",
      "cellIndex": 42,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "code",
      "source": "x_over = x_EL_ing_sol.subs(zeta, 2).simplify()\nx_over",
      "sourceSha256": "2f4af25bed1c45572c3732c2f86fc940c3b3b04150b05d281d0bb0313cedfe25",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "execute_result",
          "text/plain": "    ⎛    √3⋅ω⋅t       -√3⋅ω⋅t⎞  -2⋅ω⋅t\nx = ⎝C₁⋅ℯ       + C₂⋅ℯ       ⎠⋅ℯ      ",
          "text/latex": "$\\displaystyle x = \\left(C_{1} e^{\\sqrt{3} \\omega t} + C_{2} e^{- \\sqrt{3} \\omega t}\\right) e^{- 2 \\omega t}$"
        }
      ],
      "outputMimeTypes": [
        "image/png",
        "text/latex",
        "text/plain"
      ],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [],
        "calls": [
          "simplify",
          "x_EL_ing_sol.subs"
        ],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:43",
      "cellIndex": 43,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "there will also be an exponential approach to $x=0$, but there may be violent oscillations before reaching the equilibrium point.",
      "sourceSha256": "20ccf964f72d4666928a1f6634099ec388e9f95d19e881ef98d4f5ed1c85c707",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": [
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "x=0"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:44",
      "cellIndex": 44,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "code",
      "source": "over_condInit = [sm.Eq(x_0, x_over.args[1].subs(t, 0) ), sm.Eq(dx_0, x_over.args[1].diff(t).subs(t, 0) ) ]\nover_condInit_sol = sm.solve(over_condInit)\nx_over_condInit = x_over.subs(over_condInit_sol[0] )\nx_over_condInit.simplify()",
      "sourceSha256": "06fa7598c8b4da857921c46d783e3be03bf92e109a99f7afcb135ae84d9642fb",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "execute_result",
          "text/plain": "    ⎛                                                                   2⋅√3⋅ω\n    ⎝-√3⋅\\dot{x}₀ - ω⋅x₀⋅(-3 + 2⋅√3) + (√3⋅\\dot{x}₀ + ω⋅x₀⋅(3 + 2⋅√3))⋅ℯ      \nx = ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n                                                6⋅ω                           \n\n⋅t⎞  -ω⋅t⋅(√3 + 2)\n  ⎠⋅ℯ             \n──────────────────\n                  ",
          "text/latex": "$\\displaystyle x = \\frac{\\left(- \\sqrt{3} \\dot{x}_0 - \\omega x_{0} \\left(-3 + 2 \\sqrt{3}\\right) + \\left(\\sqrt{3} \\dot{x}_0 + \\omega x_{0} \\cdot \\left(3 + 2 \\sqrt{3}\\right)\\right) e^{2 \\sqrt{3} \\omega t}\\right) e^{- \\omega t \\left(\\sqrt{3} + 2\\right)}}{6 \\omega}$"
        }
      ],
      "outputMimeTypes": [
        "image/png",
        "text/latex",
        "text/plain"
      ],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [],
        "calls": [
          "diff",
          "sm.Eq",
          "sm.solve",
          "subs",
          "x_over.subs",
          "x_over_condInit.simplify"
        ],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:45",
      "cellIndex": 45,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Using the same initial conditions",
      "sourceSha256": "6abd5fa7f426a98c7510cb41fbedcaf0c3856ed28d23eaf6d98f2a070c43f766",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
