    {
      "sourceRef": "index:47",
      "cellIndex": 47,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### Under-damped, $0< \\zeta < 1$\nThe most frequent case is when it is desired that the damping not be abrupt",
      "sourceSha256": "f6cc46b44ce4e86fb0c71a078885fa1f4bf096746372f4bf7904f940866d8a6f",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": [
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "0< \\zeta < 1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:48",
      "cellIndex": 48,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "code",
      "source": "x_sub = x_EL_ing_sol.subs(zeta, 0.2)\nx_sub",
      "sourceSha256": "64fdf0eb4772ca923bf408580822b1c09526204310c08bef6b635b2c1c9ab83e",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "execute_result",
          "text/plain": "        ω⋅t⋅(-0.2 + 0.979795897113271⋅ⅈ)       -ω⋅t⋅(0.2 + 0.979795897113271⋅ⅈ\nx = C₁⋅ℯ                                 + C₂⋅ℯ                               \n\n)\n ",
          "text/latex": "$\\displaystyle x = C_{1} e^{\\omega t \\left(-0.2 + 0.979795897113271 i\\right)} + C_{2} e^{- \\omega t \\left(0.2 + 0.979795897113271 i\\right)}$"
        }
      ],
      "outputMimeTypes": [
        "image/png",
        "text/latex",
        "text/plain"
      ],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [],
        "calls": [
          "x_EL_ing_sol.subs"
        ],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:49",
      "cellIndex": 49,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "The complex exponentials with $i t$ can be rewritten as trigonometric functions using Euler's identity $\\mathrm{e}^{\\pm i \\theta}= \\cos{\\theta}+ i \\sin{\\theta}$.\n$$\nx= \\left[ (C_1+ C_2) \\cos{\\omega t} + i(C_1- C_2) \\sin{\\omega t} \\right] \\operatorname{e}^{- \\zeta \\omega t}\n$$\nwhich shows that a reduction in the amplitude of oscillations around the equilibrium position will be observed.\n\nAnd write a solution of the dynamics as a function of such conditions",
      "sourceSha256": "7a1efb6065346b94ff84e79fd1068d51d514dc1f4aac4430d69e820897dc1da8",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": [
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "i t"
        },
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "\\mathrm{e}^{\\pm i \\theta}= \\cos{\\theta}+ i \\sin{\\theta}"
        },
        {
          "kind": "display",
          "latex": "\nx= \\left[ (C_1+ C_2) \\cos{\\omega t} + i(C_1- C_2) \\sin{\\omega t} \\right] \\operatorname{e}^{- \\zeta \\omega t}\n"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:50",
      "cellIndex": 50,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "code",
      "source": "sub_condInit = [sm.Eq(x_0, x_sub.args[1].subs(t, 0) ), sm.Eq(dx_0, x_sub.args[1].diff(t).subs(t, 0) ) ]\nsub_condInit_sol = sm.solve(sub_condInit)\nx_sub_condInit = x_sub.subs(sub_condInit_sol[0] )\nx_sub_condInit",
      "sourceSha256": "006da6b43ce387fdb9f8e95b521298386088f87d63232d0a2a78fe09e86a9a02",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "execute_result",
          "text/plain": "                                                                              \n    5.10310363079829e-16⋅ⅈ⋅(1.0e+15⋅\\dot{x}₀ + ω⋅x₀⋅(200000000000000.0 - 97979\nx = ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n                                                                 ω            \n\n                  -ω⋅t⋅(0.2 + 0.979795897113271⋅ⅈ)                            \n5897113271.0⋅ⅈ))⋅ℯ                                   5.10310363079829e-16⋅ⅈ⋅(1\n────────────────────────────────────────────────── - ─────────────────────────\n                                                                              \n\n                                                                   ω⋅t⋅(-0.2 +\n.0e+15⋅\\dot{x}₀ + ω⋅x₀⋅(200000000000000.0 + 979795897113271.0⋅ⅈ))⋅ℯ           \n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n                                    ω                                         \n\n 0.979795897113271⋅ⅈ)\n                     \n─────────────────────\n                     ",
          "text/latex": "$\\displaystyle x = \\frac{5.10310363079829 \\cdot 10^{-16} i \\left(1.0 \\cdot 10^{15} \\dot{x}_0 + \\omega x_{0} \\cdot \\left(200000000000000.0 - 979795897113271.0 i\\right)\\right) e^{- \\omega t \\left(0.2 + 0.979795897113271 i\\right)}}{\\omega} - \\frac{5.10310363079829 \\cdot 10^{-16} i \\left(1.0 \\cdot 10^{15} \\dot{x}_0 + \\omega x_{0} \\cdot \\left(200000000000000.0 + 979795897113271.0 i\\right)\\right) e^{\\omega t \\left(-0.2 + 0.979795897113271 i\\right)}}{\\omega}$"
        }
      ],
      "outputMimeTypes": [
        "image/png",
        "text/latex",
        "text/plain"
      ],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
